=2 Walkthrough
* **(Optional)**: Speak with {n:Elijah} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (F-6) for some dialogue.
* Speak with {n:Shami} in {z:Port Jeuno} (H-8) for a cutscene to begin the mission.
* Head to {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} and speak with {n:Valaineral R Davilles} (H-8) for a cutscene.
** Since Valaineral is a {p:Campaign} NPC, he might be out of town until his return from battle. (If Valaineral doesn't appear after returning you may need to zone out and return)
*** Speaking to {n:Voucheramme} {@g:San d'Oria}, {n:Hinrich} {@g:Bastok}, or {n:Dallus-Mallus} {@g:Windurst} can help track the Royal Guards' current location.
* Head to {z:Batallia Downs (S)} at the eastern edge of (G-7) and touch the shiny **Secret Entrance** to enter {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} or Campaign Warp to {z:Batallia Downs (S)} will place you close to the **Secret Entrance**.
* Head to (F-9) and interact with the **Egg Discovery Site** location to start a cutscene.
** {n:Noillurie} (M-7/8) must be available and not conducting a Campaign Operation. The site will inform you if she is injured or unavailable.
*** Speaking to {n:Voucheramme} {@g:San d'Oria}, {n:Hinrich} {@g:Bastok}, or {n:Dallus-Mallus} {@g:Windurst} can help track the Knights of the Red Rose's current location.
* Check the **Egg Discovery Site** again to start a battle with Sa'Jho Shieldbreaker (PLD), Enkelados (BST) with 3 Saplings, and Sharpshot Luttdrutt (RNG).
** The time limit is 15 minutes.
** All enemies except for the Saplings are immune to sleep and break. Sa'Jho Shieldbreaker is immune to Silence, but really didn't heal the others.
** You will need to pull the RNG off the ledge, as it always spawns up there.
** You can stand up on the ledge above the glowing spot and have them come to you at RNG spawn point and save pulling him down.
** Enkelados can use {p:Charm} if his saplings are defeated first.
*** Otherwise, he tends to use {p:Familiar} instead.
* After winning the battle, check the **Egg Discovery Site** for another cutscene.
* Return to {n:Valaineral R Davilles} (H-8) for a cutscene and your rewards.

=2 Notes
* At this point, you can now open up access to two new {p:Records of Eminence} objectives. See the NPC {n:Elijah} in {z:Upper Jeuno} near Home Point #1 for more information.

